# BUILD CHANGE vs the previous reference string, decoded by execution probe:
#   lost    Sundered Firmament, Meteorites, Stellar Amplification,
#           Killer Instinct
#   gained  Elune's Guidance, Orbit Breaker, Sunseeker Mushroom,
#           Astral Influence, Incapacitating Roar, Improved Stampeding Roar
#
# Elune's Guidance is the one that touches the rotation: it modifies spell
# 394013, which is Incarnation: Chosen of Elune, NOT Convoke the Spirits -- the
# tooltip names Convoke in a second clause and reading it first gets this
# backwards. It cuts Incarnation's cooldown AND its duration, so ttd_incarnation
# (25, measured by counting Incarnations per pull on the OLD build) is stale
# until re-measured.
#
# Starweaver is still absent, so every "Starweaver dead on this string" comment
# in the YAML stays accurate.

